Dialogue: 50,0:01:38.24,0:01:39.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dang it!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.64,0:03:52.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KID PIRATES] Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.36,0:03:55.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kid Pirate!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.56,0:04:04.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told you!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.72,0:04:05.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told you!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:43.94,0:05:44.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.64,0:05:49.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aw, come on!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.47,0:06:02.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.13,0:06:07.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHANKS] A big shot showed up because\NI bummed around too long.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.47,0:07:55.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.83,0:08:09.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.91,0:08:20.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A Cannon.
