Dialogue: 50,0:01:38.87,0:01:43.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thing is, I got beef\Nwith the World Government.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:43.71,0:01:46.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Apparently, they're\Nnot just killing Stella,
Dialogue: 50,0:01:46.01,0:01:47.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they're gonna kill me, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:47.97,0:01:51.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So rude, am I right?\NAm I right?!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:51.85,0:01:53.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Say it's rude!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:53.72,0:01:55.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Correct. It's very rude.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:55.35,0:01:56.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You paused!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:56.86,0:01:59.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But anyways, I got a plan\Nto turn this thing around!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.22,0:02:04.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So your job is to help\Nmama kill some people
Dialogue: 50,0:02:04.76,0:02:06.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who are annoying her, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.68,0:02:09.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I shut the Frontier Dome,\Nso I want everyone in here dead,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:09.73,0:02:12.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,except me, Stella,\Nand the hostages underground.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.43,0:02:14.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say "roger" if you got all that.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:14.32,0:02:16.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ALL] Roger!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.26,0:02:18.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sweetness. Now, when you\Nstart kicking their butts,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:19.00,0:02:20.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,problem is, the Punks'll go,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.84,0:02:22.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Wait, who's ordering\Nthese things?"
Dialogue: 50,0:02:22.95,0:02:24.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And then they'll catch me!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.61,0:02:26.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't beat 'em in a fair fight,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:26.67,0:02:28.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so I need a backup plan!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:28.63,0:02:30.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cue S-Snake!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:30.32,0:02:31.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.31,0:02:32.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You gotta petrify me.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.93,0:02:34.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And do it in front\Nof them, all right?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.75,0:02:35.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[S-SNAKE] Right.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:35.68,0:02:38.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then come back and undo\Nit when no one's looking!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:38.13,0:02:39.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.71,0:02:42.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[YORK] Oh! Before I forget,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.06,0:02:45.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,there's a couple places\Nin the lab you shouldn't blow up.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.00,0:02:51.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is important,\Nso listen real carefully.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.08,0:02:55.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ready. Steady. Hunt!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.37,0:03:05.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[EGGHEAD CITIZENS screaming]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.66,0:03:19.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CITIZEN A] Everyone\Non the ship! Quick!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.17,0:03:22.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CITIZEN B] We need\Nto get off Egghead, now!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.07,0:03:46.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:48.35,0:03:51.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KID] Everyone ready?\NLet's get to work.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.64,0:03:53.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BOTH laugh]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.91,0:04:00.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Only a fool would\Noppose our chief.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.17,0:04:01.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're gonna die today.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.55,0:04:02.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KID laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.69,0:04:07.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE A] No!\NNot the frog thing!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.94,0:04:10.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get lost or croak, ribbit!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.99,0:04:15.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah! What he said!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.64,0:04:18.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE B] Pops,\Nyour dentures!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.08,0:04:21.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PURURU] Away with you,\Nfools! I do not like you!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.25,0:04:24.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You will never reach Chiefie!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.76,0:04:29.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go away! Now! Or I\Nshall be cross with you!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:32.33,0:04:34.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is Red Hair mocking us?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.83,0:04:37.05,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}These can't be his real allies.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.70,0:04:41.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How do these clowns even\Nsurvive in the New World?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.09,0:04:43.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KILLER] I get\Nwhat you mean,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.33,0:04:45.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but he's got a few\Nfamous names in there.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.14,0:04:47.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't get sloppy.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.56,0:04:51.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whether they're weak or strong,\NI'm not here to show mercy.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.84,0:04:59.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHANKS] Are we\Nready to set sail?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.59,0:05:00.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[RED-HAIRED PIRATE D]\NHey, Boss!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.82,0:05:02.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The other crews\Nwent out to stop Kid!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.01,0:05:04.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHANKS] Then tell\Nthem to retreat!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.84,0:05:06.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't want them\Ndying for nothing.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.56,0:05:09.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES] Whoa, whoa,\Nwhoa! Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.84,0:05:11.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE C yelps]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.32,0:05:15.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES] C'mon, Chief!\NWhat are you tryin' to pull?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.81,0:05:17.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHANKS] I think I\Nshould be asking you that.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.04,0:05:19.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll handle this!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.22,0:05:21.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They won't lay\Na damn finger on you!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.10,0:05:22.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BOTH] That's right!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.97,0:05:26.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks, guys.\NFor the offer, I mean.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.46,0:05:28.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But seriously, stay put.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.47,0:05:32.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES arguing]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.24,0:05:37.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES shouting]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.57,0:05:38.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please don't go!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:39.03,0:05:41.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At least let us\Nfight beside you!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:45.82,0:05:48.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughs]\NWhoa, that's enough! Easy!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.43,0:05:51.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aw, c'mon! You can't\Nbe takin' off already!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.65,0:05:53.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you just got here!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.30,0:05:55.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've hardly had\Na chance to chat!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.28,0:05:56.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHANKS] We\Ngot places to be.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.77,0:05:59.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was just stoppin'\Nhere for a quick drink.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.11,0:06:02.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but let me\Ngo, guys. C'mon.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.95,0:06:11.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHANKS] Alright, one more\Ntime. Tell the ships to retreat!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:11.40,0:06:12.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know I'd take you,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.68,0:06:15.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I can't be seen\Nwith a bunch of weaklings.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.26,0:06:16.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE I laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:16.14,0:06:17.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:17.66,0:06:19.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE I] Tell us\Nhow you really feel!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.93,0:06:21.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OLI] What does it\Nmatter if we're weak?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.79,0:06:24.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're invincible as long\Nas we have your flag!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.52,0:06:26.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHANKS] Don't get\Ntoo comfortable, Oli.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:26.12,0:06:28.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My flag can't scare\Noff old age for ya.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.55,0:06:30.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OLI] Ha-ha! Do you hear\Nthe way he talks to me?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.91,0:06:32.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No respect for his elders!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.86,0:06:35.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Boss!\NYour fans can wait.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.57,0:06:36.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHANKS] Oh, please.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.49,0:06:39.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh, we'll wrap this up in two\Nshakes of a drumstick.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.19,0:06:39.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.99,0:06:43.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't get cocky. Kid's\Nworth three billion, y'know?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.16,0:06:46.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They grow up fast these days.\NYou gotta be careful.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.54,0:06:51.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHANKS] But they had\Na hell of a fight in Wano.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.11,0:06:52.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does it look like\Ntheir wounds have healed?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.96,0:06:56.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh. They're\Nin tip-top shape.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.24,0:06:57.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Definitely ready for a fight.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.40,0:06:59.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's good to hear.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.99,0:07:03.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What about Blackbeard?\NAny updates yet?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.00,0:07:06.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No. All we know is that\Nhe left Pirate Island.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.31,0:07:10.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was so sure he'd show\Nup in the Land of Wano.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.54,0:07:11.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hongo!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.48,0:07:15.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ready. Here's\Nyour intel on Kid.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.68,0:07:16.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[RED-HAIRED PIRATE E]\NWe're so proud of you,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.72,0:07:18.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,turning your homework\Nin on time.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.49,0:07:21.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's enough! We\Ngot a ship to load!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.51,0:07:24.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHANKS] I see. So he's\Nfrom the South Blue.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.90,0:07:27.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And it looks like he's gone\Non quite the rampage.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.37,0:07:33.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KID] How many\Nships are there?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.09,0:07:34.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KILLER] Nine total.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.39,0:07:38.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There are some faces I've\Nseen on wanted posters.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.00,0:07:53.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KID yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.90,0:07:57.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KID] I don't care\Nwho we're up against!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.62,0:08:03.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let them come!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.20,0:08:06.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll wipe them all out\Nin ten seconds flat!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.94,0:08:08.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.41,0:08:17.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE K] He's pulling\Nthe ship! Do something!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.05,0:08:18.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.79,0:08:23.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll crush you under my feet!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.45,0:08:25.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm going straight to the top,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.79,0:08:29.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and I won't let anyone\Nget in my way!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:33.40,0:08:35.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.18,0:08:41.52,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,See you in hell!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.62,0:08:47.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.26,0:09:04.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.35,0:09:17.94,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Red Hair!\NThe next one's for you!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.94,0:09:21.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it. Tell the fleet\Nto spread out!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.99,0:09:23.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You see somethin', Boss?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:23.45,0:09:25.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dorry! Brogy! Get ready!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.20,0:09:27.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[DORRY, BROGY]\NWe were born ready!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.78,0:09:30.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHANKS] Hard to port!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.96,0:09:39.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Too much power.\NHe'll kill them!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.46,0:09:49.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess he saw\Na future he didn't like.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.76,0:09:59.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See you in hell!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:01.23,0:10:03.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHANKS] Should've\Nexpected this!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.47,0:10:13.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.06,0:10:20.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You kept me waiting!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.52,0:10:26.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHANKS] Divine Departure.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.21,0:11:32.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Open your eyes,\Nplease! Get up!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.43,0:11:36.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PAPAS] Damn it! Killer got\Nhurt trying to protect him!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.37,0:11:46.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HEAT] No! Stop, Red Hair!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.04,0:11:48.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We surrender!\NPlease, have mercy!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:48.16,0:11:51.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're begging you,\Nplease don't kill our boss!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:54.67,0:11:56.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, Emma. Bring them out.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.70,0:11:58.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(735.5,1053)}– [EMMA] Huh?\N– Hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.28,0:12:04.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HEAT] These are\Nour Road Poneglyphs!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.43,0:12:06.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All the ones we've got!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.12,0:12:10.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can have them,\Njust please let us live!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.86,0:12:17.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.21,0:12:24.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Chief! Time to go!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.51,0:12:43.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys.\NLook over there!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.44,0:12:53.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not over.\NSomething's coming!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.52,0:13:03.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.03,0:13:05.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[DORRY laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.66,0:13:08.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, little ones, you\Nknow what happens
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.32,0:13:10.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,when you point a gun\Nat someone's home, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.91,0:13:13.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROGY laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:13.66,0:13:17.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You better be ready for them\Nto start shooting back.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.93,0:13:24.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BOTH] Hakoku!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:39.41,0:13:40.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.55,0:14:03.44,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR] Thus,\Nthe battle at Elbaph ended.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.13,0:14:05.68,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR] Eustass\N"Captain" Kid,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.68,0:14:07.97,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,with a bounty of three\Nbillion berries,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.97,0:14:12.02,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,fell alongside his crew,\Nthe Kid Pirates.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:12.52,0:14:14.40,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,It was a massacre.
